  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "8:52 P.M. \\ Cloudy\nLungmen Slums"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Tell us where the Rat King is and nobody has to die!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slum Dweller",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wh- what?! What's a Rat King... I don't even know what that is!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I dare you to say 'what' again...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hey, Mr. Capone said not to rough up civilians..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Does this piece of shit look like a civilian to you? I bet you're Infected, ain't you, cazzo? You still wanna play dumb?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slum Dweller",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "P- please! Don't hurt me! I really don't know anything!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Cat got your tongue?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slum Dweller",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ng... gah... glehh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "C'mon, forget about this one. It ain't worth it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Checking our list, looks like the next lucky contestant is some poor finball hawker. Lives right around here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Sounds like a waste of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slum Dweller",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gah... aaagh! They broke... my arm... those sons of..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slum Dweller",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I have to... tell them..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "That's him. Over there."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "...Can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Hold up. Check the mug over there. I got a bad feeling about him.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Some Lungmen triad? Mr. Capone says they're a bunch of pushovers.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I got a question for ya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We don't want any trouble, right? Just give us a clean answer and we'll be on our way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "...There's blood on your knuckles."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Oh, pardon me. I was cleaning out the trash earlier."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But a couple of upright citizens like yourselves, you ain't trash, are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Is that a threat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You're a smart girl, you can figure it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Then I refuse to help you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "...refuse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I think that came out wrong, girly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It sounded like you said you were dumpster garbage eager to get beaten half to death in that alleyway over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Waai Fu, I'm pretty sure that scream I just heard was..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Was 'garbage,' the word you just used?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Because one must be thorough and prepared for all eventualities, I will ask one more question: is that how you refer to the people here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I don't got time to waste talkin' shit with you, start talk——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wh- what was that?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You better——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gah?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Next."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "You know what, the kind of scum you are, I'll take you all on at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Not once in recorded history has evil triumphed over justice, and you evildoers who indiscriminately prey on the weak are not even worth a mention."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What is this?! How does she move like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Just shoot her alrea——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "...not so fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gah! Hey! Let go of me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "You know what you remind me of? A rotten finfish three days after the freezer lost power."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "...nothing. I shouldn't try to copy Waai Fu's battle banter. I'll take the direct approach."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "S- so strong! Agh! Y- you're gonna break my arm! Stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Drop your weapon. And get out of my sight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Al- alright already! Just let me go!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "...I should probably break a bone or two just to be safe. You've got a real dangerous weapon there, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Aaagh! P- please stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wh- what's the deal with these two? Nobody warned us about any targets around here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Just get the hell outta here first. We'll talk later."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I don't care what crew you guys are with, next time ain't gonna go your way. Damned Lungmenites."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Come on, we're not triads. Why do they always have to judge a book by its cover...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "Forget it, there's people to save. Over there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Oh, right."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "Don't move! We're here to help!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slum Dweller",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ah Fil?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "You're fine. It's just a flesh wound. Sit still and I'll go get a doctor. I won't be long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slum Dweller",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ah Fil! Don't worry about me. You have to go find Uncle Tung!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Slum Dweller",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "That's where they're going next!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jaye",
      "speakerId": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
